  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to victim-survivors of SEAH through Women&apos;s Rights Organisations (WROs)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme will strengthen support to victim-survivors of SEAH by engaging Women&#x2019;s Rights Organisations (WROs) and include action research so that evidence on &apos;what works&apos; is generated. It will also fund UN mechanisms that support the survivors of SEAH perpetrated by UN personnel.</narrative>
  </description>
